---
import CorporateLayout from '../layouts/CorporateLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---

<CorporateLayout
  title="About"
  description="How Trinity Laboratories approaches applied research, testing, field work, and technical documentation."
  active="about"
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="About Trinity Laboratories"
    title="Good research starts with your question."
    intro="We bring testing, measurement, and field work together to help you understand a practical problem."
    index="TL / ABOUT"
  />

  <section class="section" data-reveal>
    <div class="editorial-grid">
      <p class="prose-large">
        We help you decide what to test, how to test it, and what the results mean.
      </p>
      <div>
        <p class="section-label">Our approach</p>
        <p>
          Some questions need a single test. Others need several disciplines working together. We
          agree on the scope, keep a record of the work, and explain its limits.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--dark" data-reveal>
    <div class="section__heading">
      <p class="section-label">How we work</p>
      <h2>A clear plan, from question to findings.</h2>
      <p>We document what we set out to do, what we observed, and what still needs an answer.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="ruled-list">
      <li>
        <small>01</small><strong>Agree on what the project needs to answer.</strong><span
          >Scope</span
        >
      </li>
      <li>
        <small>02</small><strong>Choose the tools and write down the test plan.</strong><span
          >Control</span
        >
      </li>
      <li>
        <small>03</small><strong>Record observations before interpreting them.</strong><span
          >Evidence</span
        >
      </li>
      <li>
        <small>04</small><strong>Explain the findings and keep a record of changes.</strong><span
          >Record</span
        >
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="section" data-reveal>
    <div class="section__heading">
      <p class="section-label">Documentation</p>
      <h2>Work you can return to and review.</h2>
      <p>
        We preserve original records and their revisions so methods, decisions, and results can be
        understood over time.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="button-row">
      <a class="button button--primary" href="/publications/">Browse publications</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</CorporateLayout>
